        "role": "user",
        "content": "Task t-f53d4a1a for case c-agent001, owner nurse n-a1.\nGoal: Complete the discharge paperwork for this patient.\nNow: minute 490. Adopted workflow version 1.\nAcceptance conditions, derived by the runtime from the adopted version and the ward requirements in force:\n- discharge_summary.draft (record rec-63cc390c): not met\n- discharge_summary.final (record rec-d722a158): not met\n- refund_voucher.draft (record rec-18fd4e1b): not met\n- refund_voucher.final (record rec-5b9fc130): not met\nAgent actions so far:\n- a-52fcece9 ask_staff doctor: completed\nWhy this turn: wake w-612c1426 matched event ev-795a1d52.\nRecorded since minute 480:\n- 490 world.due st02\n- 490 step.completed st02 by doctor\n- 490 record.versioned take_home_order"
